 - `--format <json|markdown>` – output format (defaults to JSON). Markdown reports include human-readable summaries for review boards.
+- `--threshold <metric>=<min>` – gate CI on metric scores. Supply multiple times for multiple thresholds. Exit code 1 if any threshold fails, 0 if all pass (or none specified), 2 for usage errors. For example: `--threshold exact_match=0.9 --threshold toxicity=0.95`. A metric with no score fails its threshold rather than crashing.
 
